,["Shallot","ingredient/shallot"],["Vinegar","ingredient/vinegar"]]}]},"dish/chaat-masala":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/chaat-masala","n":"Chaat masala","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Indian cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Chaat masala, also spelled chat masala, is a powdered spice mix, or masala, originating from the Indian subcontinent, typically used to add flavor to chaat. It typically consists of amchoor (dried mango powder), cumin, coriander, dried ginger, salt (often black salt), black pepper, asafoetida, and chili powder. Garam masala is optional."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-chaat-masala"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaat_masala"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Indian cuisine","cuisine/indian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Swasthi's Recipes","ref":"site/indianhealthyrecipes-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"indianhealthyrecipes.com","note":"Swasthi Shreekanth's long-running blog of everyday Indian home cooking from across the regions.","url":"https://www.indianhealthyrecipes.com/about/","suggested":true},{"name":"Hari Ghotra","ref":"site/harighotra-co-uk","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"harighotra.co.uk","note":"UK-based cook Hari Ghotra's recipe library and videos of home-style Indian dishes.","url":"https://www.harighotra.co.uk/indian-recipes","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Indian cuisine","links":[["Akuri","dish/akuri"],["Aloo paratha","dish/aloo-paratha"],["Amba (condiment)","dish/amba-condiment"],["Annapurna Cafe","dish/annapurna-cafe"],["Baingan bharta","dish/baingan-bharta"],["Bombay potato","dish/bombay-potato"],["Butter chicken","dish/butter-chicken"],["Chai Pani","dish/chai-pani"],["Chicken Chettinad","dish/chicken-chettinad"],["Chutney Mary","dish/chutney-mary"],["Dahi vada","dish/dahi-vada"],["Dal dhokli","dish/dal-dhokli"],["Dal makhani","dish/dal-makhani"],["Dhamaka (restaurant)","dish/dhamaka-restaurant"],["